      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's up to the avatar author/uploader to make sure that the parameters are in the correct order. Not really a bug with VRChat itself, synced parameters are serialized in order, and decoded via the parameters, so if those don't match up between quest and PC version, you will have cross platform issues like that.",
