  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "me and a friend came across an interesting across platform issue\n\nWhere I was in an avatar that is quest compatible but when I change\n\nclothes they can't seem to see the change, and to make sure that it\n\nwasn't just the avatar, we decided to test it with several, and they\n\nwere able to see the clothing change on those ones but it doesn't \n\nappear anymore, I was intrigued by by glitch or error, so I got onto\n\nmy quest joined my friend and swap, into the same avatar that I\n\nwas in earlier and we performed the same exact test, they were\n\nable to see the clothing change just fine.\n\nI'm wondering if anyone else has a counterfeits issue?\n\nPerhaps with avatar props or accessories.",
